        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cape Verde, a small African country with only 550,000 people, has made history. And for the first time, they will play in the World Cup! The whole country is full of pride and excitement."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In its capital "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Praia",
            "zh": "普拉亚"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", streets were filled with joy. People waved flags and cheered for their national team, the “Blue Sharks”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“I am too excited to say anything. We never stopped believing in our team,” said one happy fan."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The success is an important moment for Cape Verde, especially its young people. The country is now the smallest in Africa to ever reach the World Cup."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Blue Sharks’ journey to the World Cup was not easy. They trained hard day after day and fought through many difficult matches to achieve this dream. “This "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "victory",
            "ref": "v-victory"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " belongs to all of our people,” said the team’s coach."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“I’m so proud. We’ve been waiting for this moment for so long,” said a local fan."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
