            "zh": "守门员"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shared the same feeling: “I’ve been dreaming of this moment since I was a child.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "With Cape Verde’s success, six African teams have now got their tickets for the 2026 World Cup."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
